# Datasheet PDFs are deliberately not tracked. docs/manifest.json is the tracked
# stand-in: it records where each PDF belongs, what it is and where to get it again.
# docs/browse.bat opens them, fetching on demand into a cache outside the repo
# (%LOCALAPPDATA%\temp_sensor\datasheets by default). The Datasheet Browser itself
# lives in the water_tank checkout; see docs/README.md.
*.pdf
